  SPEC.md 4.4a - batch three.

  ============================================================================================
  SCOPE CHANGE, made deliberately and on the user's explicit instruction
  ============================================================================================
  Drain Vitality (Gaan Lah Haas) and Dismay (Faas Ru Maar) were both on SPEC.md 4.4c's DEFERRED
